{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/27d7139dcd1a4a74d7a3531d7d5189b2.avif?t=1767325570\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras_big/27d7139dcd1a4a74d7a3531d7d5189b2.avif?t=1767325570 width=800 height=189 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for control during the Friso-Hollandic Wars. Set in the medieval 13th century, the game features a strategy campaign and historical battles. Fight alongside your army in 3rd person battles and command your troops in this strategy-action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voor de kroon is a medieval wargame.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.poster.avif?t=1767325570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.webm?t=1767325570\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/dc4797d171587966c83b695ad3ab50ec.mp4?t=1767325570\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The game uses Unreal Engine and Metahuman technology to make the historically researched characters come alive.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1702390/extras/6be8c07df8f3b1105ae8715d20fada48.poster.avif?t=1767325570\" width=1170 height=390 ><source 